# reCAPTCHA v3 site key (public, not secret) lives in
# src/templates/contact.html's data-recaptcha-site-key attribute — that is the
# ONLY place it is set, for every environment. There is no env var for it; a
# prior VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY GitHub Actions secret used to override it
# silently, drifted out of sync, and is what broke the contact form.
#
# The matching SECRET key is the RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY Worker secret
# (`npx wrangler secret put RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY`). The two are a pair and must
# be rotated together — see the two-halves rule in docs/RUNBOOK.md.
#
# This file intentionally defines no variables. The build reads none.
